Release Notes phyGATE-M Topic release
==========================================

BSP-Yocto-phyGATE-Tauri-M-i.MX93-v1.0   2026-08-28
=================================================
- Based on PD26.1.0 for imx93
- Linux NXP Vendor Kernel v6.12.34-2.1.0-phy9 (based on NXP tag lf-6.12.34-2.1.0)
- U-boot v2025.04-2.1.0-phy9 (based on NXP tag lf-6.12.34-2.1.0)
- Yocto 5.2.2 (walnascar)
- Qt 6.8.3
- RAUC 1.14

Tested Yocto Images:
--------------------
- phytec-headless-image

Build Environment:
------------------
- Ubuntu 24.04 64-Bit

Features:
---------
- Added support for phyGATE-Tauri-M-i.MX93
- USB 2.0
- 2x Ethernet
- uSD
- CAN
- RS232
- RS486
- Temp Sensor
- LEDs
- RTC RV3020
